{"texte":"There's a piece of land in Africa that no country on Earth wants. It's called Bir Tawil, two thousand square kilometers of desert between Egypt and Sudan. The problem? Two different borders, drawn by the British in 1899 and in 1902. Draw the 1899 line, and Egypt gets the Halaib Triangle, ten times bigger, on the Red Sea. Sudan gets Bir Tawil. Draw the 1902 line, and it's the exact opposite. Both countries want Halaib, so each one picks the line that gives it Halaib, and leaves Bir Tawil to the other. So nobody claims it. No government, no permanent residents, just sand and rocks. In 2014, an American planted a flag there so his daughter could be a real princess. No country recognized it. It's one of the last places on land that belongs to no one.","caracteres":["T","h","e","r","e","'","s"," ","a"," ","p","i","e","c","e"," ","o","f"," ","l","a","n","d"," ","i","n"," ","A","f","r","i","c","a"," ","t","h","a","t"," ","n","o"," ","c","o","u","n","t","r","y"," ","o","n"," ","E","a","r","t","h"," ","w","a","n","t","s","."," ","I","t","'","s"," ","c","a","l","l","e","d"," ","B","i","r"," ","T","a","w","i","l",","," ","t","w","o"," ","t","h","o","u","s","a","n","d"," ","s","q","u","a","r","e"," ","k","i","l","o","m","e","t","e","r","s"," ","o","f"," ","d","e","s","e","r","t"," ","b","e","t","w","e","e","n"," ","E","g","y","p","t"," ","a","n","d"," ","S","u","d","a","n","."," ","T","h","e"," ","p","r","o","b","l","e","m","?"," ","T","w","o"," ","d","i","f","f","e","r","e","n","t"," ","b","o","r","d","e","r","s",","," ","d","r","a","w","n"," ","b","y"," ","t","h","e"," ","B","r","i","t","i","s","h"," ","i","n"," ","1","8","9","9"," ","a","n","d"," ","i","n"," ","1","9","0","2","."," ","D","r","a","w"," ","t","h","e"," ","1","8","9","9"," ","l","i","n","e",","," ","a","n","d"," ","E","g","y","p","t"," ","g","e","t","s"," ","t","h","e"," ","H","a","l","a","i","b"," ","T","r","i","a","n","g","l","e",","," ","t","e","n"," ","t","i","m","e","s"," ","b","i","g","g","e","r